+export const PRODUCT_VERSION = 'studio-marketing-v1';
+
+export const PRODUCT_BRIEF = `Bootfile Marketing Setup serves solo service-business owners who need to prepare one concrete promotion.
+The offer is $49 once, with no subscription. The customer supplies a business brief, their actual offer, audience, facts, constraints, and tone.
+The saved result is a customer email and three coordinated social posts, a saved business brief, a reusable task setup, and a quality checklist.
+The product entry is https://bootfile.ai/studio. The business owner reviews facts and sends or posts the work themselves.
+AI memory can remember a user; it does not establish that a specific promotion is accurate or ready to use.
+Never describe Bootfile as a new personality test, an archetype quiz, a memory replacement, a chat app, or a subscription.
+Do not invent customer results, performance numbers, time saved, testimonials, citations, provider capabilities, or guaranteed sales.
+Examples must be clearly labeled fictional and use placeholders for unprovided prices, dates, availability, credentials, and customer claims.
+Do not suggest uploading confidential customer data. No unsolicited outreach or paid advertising instructions are part of this content task.
+Write useful, specific guidance in plain language. The single product mention must match the actual offer and URL above.
